<section class="ziyu-section">
  <div class="ziyu-container">
    <div style="max-width: 820px; margin-bottom: 90px;">
      <span class="ziyu-label">Roadmap</span>
      <h1 class="ziyu-h1">A transparent map of what is being built.</h1>
      <p class="ziyu-body-lg" style="margin-top: 28px;">The Ziyu ecosystem is early. This roadmap shows what is real, what is in progress, and what is still experimental.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-timeline">
      <div class="ziyu-timeline-item">
        <span class="ziyu-label">In Progress</span>
        <div>
          <h2 class="ziyu-h3">Goal Grower Prototype</h2>
          <p class="ziyu-body-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">Building the core habit, garden, and goal-tracking systems.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-timeline-item">
        <span class="ziyu-label">Research</span>
        <div>
          <h2 class="ziyu-h3">Blokkr Hardware Concept</h2>
          <p class="ziyu-body-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">Exploring physical rituals for deep work and attention boundaries.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-timeline-item">
        <span class="ziyu-label">Future</span>
        <div>
          <h2 class="ziyu-h3">MyJourney + KindLitt</h2>
          <p class="ziyu-body-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">Long-term concepts for personal archiving and calmer reading.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

